[I] Terminal based bit manipulator in ncurses

[T] Bitwise is a multi base interactive calculator for the terminal,
[T] supporting dynamic base conversion and bit manipulation through an
[T] ncurses interface. It also works as a command-line calculator for all
[T] bitwise operations such as NOT, OR, AND, XOR and shifts, aimed at kernel
[T] and device driver developers.

[U] https://github.com/mellowcandle/bitwise

[A] Bitwise Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

